<title>USA: Carson City, Nev., $2.940 mln won by Dain Bosworth.</title>
<headline>Carson City, Nev., $2.940 mln won by Dain Bosworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth said it won $2.940 million of Carson City, Nev., general obligation limited tax golf course refunding bonds, Seris May 1, 1997D, with a true interest cost of 5.03 percent.</p>
